@startuml
' Shared look for every diagram: plain black-and-white UML, course style.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
  HeaderBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam actorBorderColor #000000
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam packageBorderColor #000000
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam artifactBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam stateBorderColor #000000
skinparam objectBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam objectBorderColor #000000
skinparam entityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam boundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam controlBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam noteBorderColor #888888
skinparam titleFontSize 14
hide empty members
hide circle
left to right direction
title Q3a – Biểu đồ giao tiếp – kịch bản chuẩn Track Invoice 0 (15 bước)

actor "Khách hàng" as Actor
boundary CustomerHomeView
boundary InvoiceListView
boundary InvoiceDetailView
entity Invoice

Actor -- CustomerHomeView : 1: click subTrackInvoice >
CustomerHomeView -- InvoiceListView : 2: gọi >
InvoiceListView -- Invoice : 3: gọi >
Invoice -- Invoice : "4: getInvoiceByCustomer()\n10: getInvoiceDetail()"
Invoice -- InvoiceListView : 5: trả về >
InvoiceListView -- Actor : 6: hiển thị\n15: hiển thị >
Actor -- InvoiceListView : 7: click hóa đơn HD1024 >
InvoiceListView -- InvoiceDetailView : 8: gọi >
InvoiceDetailView -- Invoice : 9: gọi >
Invoice -- InvoiceDetailView : 11: trả về >
InvoiceDetailView -- Actor : 12: hiển thị >
Actor -- InvoiceDetailView : 13: click subBack >
InvoiceDetailView -- InvoiceListView : 14: gọi >
@enduml
